- `.local/release-fc4e6e9/installed-verification.json` and `installed-smoke.json` — local hash and functional results.

# Limits and fleet boundary
- No live router or running local session was restarted as part of this installation. Future launches use the new snapshot through `CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME`; already-running sessions continue with the code they loaded at start.
- No remote sandbox was modified, restarted, or upgraded in this goal. Kobi, emily, and edward still run their previously installed versions until an explicitly approved fleet-update goal is executed.
- Existing parallel ledgers that already contain an `enabled` value retain that value; default-on applies to ledgers that have not been written. This is deliberate and is not overwritten by the install.
